PASS  fresh-nonce idempotent retry returns original result
PASS  external ACK accepted inside its scope
PASS  external ACK rejected outside its scope
PASS  writes without idempotency key rejected
PASS  OWNER vault sealing through Gatekeeper works
PASS  monolithic Gatekeeper request interface works

